  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4211886,
    "UIName": "BattleAxe",
    "Id": "chassisdef_battleaxe_BKX-RISC",
    "Name": "BattleAxe",
    "Details": "A RISC variant of the antiquated BattleAxe, the BKX-RISC was rebuilt the from the ground up, retaining its core payload of paired particle projector cannons. Though Clan-grade weapons were available, the project lead chose not to waste them on a questionable BattleMech, opting instead for capacitors to enhance Inner Sphere ER PPCs. A RISC emergency cooling system was planned, but was sidelined in favor of the radical heat sink system. Though the resulting machine is dissimilar to Achernar's BKX-8D built on New Avalon, the choice was made to keep Federated Suns tech on a Federated Suns 'Mech in case it was captured\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "Battleaxe"
  },
  "VariantName": "BKX-RISC",
