  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "The first native Battlemech to be built by the FedSuns, the 70 ton Battleaxe debuted in 2459. Based off of the technology used in the Mackie, the Battleaxe would be constantly updated with new technology, before being retired after the Reunification War when newer designs such as the Hammerhands and Warhammer entered service. The Battleaxe BKX-8D is a Jihad era revamp of the ancient design. Built around a 280-rated Light Engine, the BKX-8D is armed with a trio of MML-7’s, with 4 ER Medium Lasers as backup weapons.",
